    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19302" root="سدج" body-key="s">
    
      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تسدّج</span></b> ; (S, L, K;) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَدَجَ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَدْجٌ</span>;
(L;) <i>He lied, affected lying,</i> or <i>lied purposely;</i>
and <i>forged,</i> or <i>fabricated:</i> (S, L, K: [in the
CK, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَخَلَّفَ</span> is erroneously put for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَخَلَّقَ</span>:]) <i>he
forged and uttered false and vain tales:</i> (L:) or
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَدَجَ</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَدِجَ</span></b> , signifies [simply] <i>he lied;</i> (O, in
the present art. and in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سرج</span>;) like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَرَجَ</span>. (O
in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سرج</span>.) [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تسرّج</span>.]

